    "label": {
      "en": "Base amount of decote for couples since 2015"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tin_decote_amt2"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The couple-specific base amount for the décote rebate calculation, in force since a 2015 reform gave jointly-taxed couples their own (higher) rebate formula distinct from the single-person case. Used alongside $tin_decote_amt as Comp_perTU in the \"Tax rebate (Decote)\" BenCalc of both tin_fr and tinkt_fr, and corresponds to the couple row of the country report's Table 2.81."
    },
